{"seq":2,"slug":"matrix-first","title":"矩阵优先思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/matrix-first","wordCount":1184,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"矩阵优先思维\">矩阵优先思维</h1><p>从 C 或 Python 转到 MATLAB 的人，最先犯的错往往不是语法错，而是世界观错——他们还在用&quot;标量加循环&quot;的方式想问题。MATLAB 的名字直译就是矩阵实验室，它的语言核心做了一个极端假设：<strong>一切默认都是矩阵</strong>。<code>x = 3</code> 创建的不是一个标量，而是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的双精度矩阵；<code>A = [1 2; 3 4]</code> 才是它眼中真正&quot;正常大小&quot;的对象。把这个假设吃透，后面的索引、运算符、性能直觉全都顺理成章；吃不透，就会一直写出能跑但慢十倍、丑十倍的代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-标量只是退化的矩阵\">核心概念：标量只是退化的矩阵</h2><p>在 MATLAB 里，没有真正的标量类型，只有形状不同的数组。一个数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 在内存里是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，一个行向量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，一个列向量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，一张图像是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\times w\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。所有这些都是同一种类型——默认是 <code>double</code>，按列优先（column-major）连续存储。这意味着你写下的几乎每个变量都自带&quot;形状&quot;这一属性，而绝大多数函数都被设计成&quot;对整个数组作用&quot;，而不是&quot;对一个元素作用、你再去循环&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[一个值] --&gt; B{形状}&#10;    B --&gt;|1×1| C[标量&lt;br/&gt;x = 3]&#10;    B --&gt;|1×n| D[行向量&lt;br/&gt;1 2 3]&#10;    B --&gt;|n×1| E[列向量]&#10;    B --&gt;|m×n| F[矩阵]&#10;    B --&gt;|m×n×p| G[多维数组&lt;br/&gt;图像/张量]&#10;    C --&gt; H[同一类型 double&lt;br/&gt;列优先存储]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[一个值] --&gt; B{形状}\n    B --&gt;|1×1| C[标量&lt;br/&gt;x = 3]\n    B --&gt;|1×n| D[行向量&lt;br/&gt;1 2 3]\n    B --&gt;|n×1| E[列向量]\n    B --&gt;|m×n| F[矩阵]\n    B --&gt;|m×n×p| G[多维数组&lt;br/&gt;图像/张量]\n    C --&gt; H[同一类型 double&lt;br/&gt;列优先存储]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>下表对比&quot;标量思维&quot;与&quot;矩阵思维&quot;在同一任务下的差异，这正是新手最该完成的心智切换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>标量思维（慢/啰嗦）</th>\n<th>矩阵思维（MATLAB 惯用）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全体加 1</td>\n<td><code>for i, x(i)=x(i)+1</code></td>\n<td><code>x = x + 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两向量逐元素乘</td>\n<td>循环逐个相乘</td>\n<td><code>x .* y</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求和</td>\n<td>累加循环</td>\n<td><code>sum(x)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大于阈值的元素</td>\n<td>循环加 if</td>\n<td><code>x(x &gt; t)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性方程组</td>\n<td>手写高斯消元</td>\n<td><code>A \\ b</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这段心智切换在代码里一眼可见，注意每行都自带&quot;形状&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"matlab\" data-code=\"x = 3;            % 1×1 double——没有标量类型，只有退化的矩阵&#10;size(x)           % 1 1&#10;A = [1 2; 3 4];   % 2×2 double，按列优先连续存储&#10;v = A(:, 2)       % 取第二列 → 2×1 列向量&#10;A(A &lt; 3) = 0      % 逻辑索引：一条语句清零所有小于 3 的元素\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x = 3;            % 1×1 double——没有标量类型，只有退化的矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>size(x)           % 1 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = [1 2; 3 4];   % 2×2 double，按列优先连续存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>v = A(:, 2)       % 取第二列 → 2×1 列向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A(A &#x3C; 3) = 0      % 逻辑索引：一条语句清零所有小于 3 的元素</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"索引-matlab-的方言\">索引：MATLAB 的方言</h2><p>MATLAB 的索引规则和大多数语言不同，是初学者第一道坎，必须单独掌握。它<strong>从 1 开始</strong>计数（不是 0），用<strong>圆括号</strong>而非方括号做索引，<code>A(i,j)</code> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 列。三种索引方式要分清：线性索引 <code>A(5)</code> 按列优先把矩阵当一维数组数；下标索引 <code>A(2,3)</code>；逻辑索引 <code>A(A&gt;0)</code> 用一个同形状的布尔数组挑元素——逻辑索引是 MATLAB 表达力的精华，能把&quot;筛选+赋值&quot;压成一行，例如 <code>A(A&lt;0) = 0</code> 把所有负元素清零。</p>\n<p>冒号 <code>:</code> 是另一个核心方言。<code>A(:,2)</code> 取第二列，<code>A(3,:)</code> 取第三行，<code>A(:)</code> 把矩阵拉直成列向量，<code>1:2:9</code> 生成 <code>[1 3 5 7 9]</code> 的等差序列。<code>end</code> 关键字表示该维度的最后一个下标，<code>A(end,:)</code> 取最后一行。这套记号让&quot;切片、重排、扩展&quot;都不必写循环——它是 <a href=\"../language/vectorization\">向量化</a> 的语法前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐式扩展-形状会自动对齐\">隐式扩展：形状会自动对齐</h2><p>MATLAB 自 R2016b 起把&quot;隐式扩展&quot;（implicit expansion，等价于 NumPy 的 broadcasting）设为默认行为。当两个数组做逐元素运算时，只要某个维度一方是 1、另一方是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，那个维度就会被自动复制对齐。于是给矩阵每列减去各列均值，可以直接写 <code>A - mean(A)</code>，而不必手动把均值向量铺成同样大小的矩阵。这条规则让矩阵思维进一步省力，但也藏着陷阱：一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 与一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 相加，会悄悄得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是报错，写错形状时不会立刻暴露。理解隐式扩展的边界，是写对向量化代码的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这套思维等于性能\">为什么这套思维等于性能</h2><p>矩阵优先不只是&quot;写得短&quot;，更是&quot;跑得快&quot;。当你写 <code>A*B</code> 或 <code>A\\b</code>，MATLAB 把这次调用直接转发给底层 BLAS/LAPACK 的多线程例程；而当你写显式 <code>for</code> 循环逐元素处理，解释器要为每次迭代承担分派开销，吃不到这些优化。所以&quot;想成矩阵&quot;在 MATLAB 里几乎总是同时换来更短的代码和数量级的提速——这条因果链在 <a href=\"../language/vectorization\">向量化</a> 一篇里会用基准数据展开，本篇只先建立直觉：循环是反模式，数组运算是默认解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MATLAB 没有真正的标量，一切都是有形状的数组，标量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的退化情形</li>\n<li>心智切换的核心：把&quot;对元素循环&quot;改成&quot;对整个数组运算&quot;</li>\n<li>索引方言要专门掌握：从 1 起、圆括号、线性/下标/逻辑三种索引、冒号与 <code>end</code></li>\n<li>逻辑索引 <code>A(A&gt;0)</code> 与隐式扩展 <code>A - mean(A)</code> 是表达力与陷阱并存的两大特性</li>\n<li>矩阵思维同时换来更短的代码与底层 BLAS/LAPACK 的数量级提速</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>把这套思维落成性能工程方法：<a href=\"../language/vectorization\">向量化</a></li>\n<li>越过双精度矩阵的其它容器：<a href=\"../language/data-types-arrays\">数据类型与数组</a></li>\n<li>矩阵思维的最大主场：<a href=\"../numerics/linear-algebra-solving\">线性代数与求解</a></li>\n<li>跨库：同样以数组为原语的开源对照 <a href=\"../../python-advanced/data-science/numpy\">Python 进阶·NumPy</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"矩阵优先思维","id":"矩阵优先思维"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：标量只是退化的矩阵","id":"核心概念-标量只是退化的矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"索引：MATLAB 的方言","id":"索引-matlab-的方言"},{"level":2,"text":"隐式扩展：形状会自动对齐","id":"隐式扩展-形状会自动对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这套思维等于性能","id":"为什么这套思维等于性能"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何 MATLAB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/why-matlab"},"next":{"title":"交互式工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/interactive-workflow"}}